{
  "sheet": "statcards",
  "about": "One row per Overtime stat card on the upgrade screen. Each row generates one StatCardDef. deltas are card points per stat (stats.json gives the units). Vanilla stat cards raise 2-3 stats one level each (about 2-3 points) and cap at level 3; Overtime points stack up to each stat's min/max.",
